    <IntroInstall Type="post" Lang="en" Title="Change Email sender module"><![CDATA[
            To send emails through different SMTP servers, set SendmailModule in System Configuration to Kernel::System::Email::MultiSMTP.<br /><br />
    ]]></IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Type="post" Lang="de" Title="E-Mail-Modul ändern"><![CDATA[
